 "_doc": "Afrikaans/English metro bill. Charge lines read 'LEVY <SERVICE> ... AMOUNT' with a separate 'VAT <SERVICE>' line; AMOUNT is the last money on the line, credits carry a leading minus (RECEIPT -25969.53). Services: WATER, RATES, SANIT(ation), REFUSE (electricity not seen in this pack - LEVY ELEC rule is structural). Water meter table gives the reading + estimate flag. FINGERPRINT (fixed Aug-2026): matched on Mangaung's own VAT registration 4780193175 only. It previously matched on '[address removed]' under 'any', which is the CBRE/Excellerate utilities mailbox that appears on MANY municipalities' statements - Dihlabeng (VAT 4000846529) and Breede Valley bills were silently routing to Mangaung. The bare VAT number is used rather than the full 'TAX INVOICE (VAT REG. NO.:4780193175)' string so label/spacing drift cannot break the match (same convention as overstrand/centlec/mbombela/emfuleni). The reject_if_text on Overstrand's VAT 4140106396 is kept as belt-and-braces. No extraction rule changed.",
